Z||000000||wkayl||10-12-2001||01:12 AM||||I replaced the valve guide seals and adjusted the valves the 1 1/2 turns as per the Haynes book.  DOH!!  I did a search and found that 1/2 to 3/4 turns is what it takes.  It wouldn't be so bad but I rembered (after the rough idle at startup) that within the last 5 days this topic was covered.  Oh well, at least this time I know how to take everything apart.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_2.jpg">    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/usa1017[1].gif">   <BR>Dnyee's 88 Formula, Casey's 86GT, Wayne's 86GT.  <BR>We consider my wife as being "Fiero Challenged"||||reg||1
